// ── tests (vic 2026-11-16): a top-level val NAME {Test}: Test.Result = e is a test; its value is computed natively: the closure of the
// tests plus a generated main (handler Test.Run) is emitted, compiled and run in child processes; the value of each test is one report line ──

// the signature of a test
def Kernel.testSig(): Str = "{Test}: Test.Result"

